WEBVTT

00:00:29.676 --> 00:00:33.836
put the latest nail in the coffin
of Mediterranean marine life.

00:00:34.556 --> 00:00:36.796
I thought nature was lost.

00:00:36.836 --> 00:00:39.156
Until I started scuba diving

00:00:39.196 --> 00:00:41.676
in the Medes Islands
marine reserve in Spain.

00:00:42.556 --> 00:00:44.196
One square kilometer

00:00:44.236 --> 00:00:47.676
fully protected from fishing
and other damaging activities.

00:00:48.916 --> 00:00:51.836
I still remember
that first dive in the reserve.

00:00:52.556 --> 00:00:55.876
As soon as I put my head underwater,

00:00:55.916 --> 00:00:58.956
I felt like diving
into one of Cousteau's films.